    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρο-θῐγής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>touching on surface,
				touching the lips</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.68
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. περὶ τὰς πράξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					40.1
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκροθιγῶς, ἐμβάπτειν</span>
			<i>just</i> dip in, <i>so that it is hardly wetted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.83
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἴρηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Marin.
					<u>Procl.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				271.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.Rh.
				p.417
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i></div>
